## What each file is for

| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `index.html` | The entire site. Markup, styles and scripts in one file. |
| `favicon.svg` | The icon in the browser tab. |
| `og-image.png` | The preview card shown when the link is shared on LinkedIn, Slack or iMessage. |
| `package.json` | The `npm run` shortcuts. No dependencies. |
| `netlify.toml` | Caching and security headers for Netlify. |
| `vercel.json` | The same, for Vercel. |
| `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` | Auto-deploy to GitHub Pages on every push. |
| `.nojekyll` | Stops GitHub Pages from reprocessing the files. |
| `robots.txt`, `sitemap.xml` | Lets search engines index the page. |

